ENGR202 Problem 3 - Run then Ctrl+L for answers
* All resistances in ohms. Current references follow the supplied diagram.
R4 L A 6
V2 A U 6
R1 U M 4
R3 A M 10
R5 0 A 8
R2 D 0 7
V1 M D 10
V3 L 0 12
